name=Second Back Slot
id=PZAttachTwoWeaponsOnBack
author=kaleido4
modversion=1.0.2
versionMin=42.0.0
poster=poster.png
icon=icon.png
description=Adds a second back slot to the hotbar, so you can carry two weapons on your back, like a shotgun and a crowbar, each on its own hotbar key. <LINE>
description= <LINE>
description=* "Back 2" sits right after "Back" on the hotbar (key 2). Belts, holsters and other slots move up one. <LINE>
description=* It takes everything the vanilla back slot takes: rifles, shotguns, axes, bats, crowbars, swords, shovels, rackets, pans, guitars. <LINE>
description= <LINE>
description=<H2>Sandbox options <LINE>
description=<TEXT>Required Strength Level (0 to 10, default 0): the Strength level a character needs for Back 2. <LINE>
description=* 0: Back 2 slot unlocked from the start. <LINE>
description=* 1-10: min level to unlock Back 2 <LINE>
description=* Only the level in the Skills panel counts. Moodles like hunger, starving or nicotine withdrawal do not change it. <LINE>
description=* If Strength drops below the level (the game only lowers it after weeks without training it), Back 2 goes away and its item stays in the inventory. The slot comes back once Strength is trained back up. <LINE>
description= <LINE>
description=Works in SP. <LINE>
description=Should work in MP, but it was not tested. <LINE>
description=Can be added to existing saves. Before removing the mod, take the item off Back 2. <LINE>
description= <LINE>
description=Does not replace game files. <LINE>
description=Build 42.
